```
Title: HackTool - Defendnot Installation via PowerShell One-Liner
Author: Swachchhanda Shrawan Poudel (Nextron Systems)
Date: 2026-10-18
Level: high
Description: Detects execution of Defendnot installation via PowerShell one-liner that downloads and executes the Defendnot script from a remote URL.
 Defendnot is a hacktool that abuses Microsoft's undocumented WSC API to disable Windows Defender by registering itself as a fake antivirus product.
MITRE Tactic: Uncategorized
Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
Reference: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/powershell/powershell_script/posh_ps_hktl_defendnot_installation.yml
 False Positives:
   - Unlikely
```
ScriptBlockText="*https://dnot.sh/*" OR (ScriptBlockText="*/defendnot*" ScriptBlockText="*github*")